{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35708","headline":"独鹄吟 · 李咸用","name":"独鹄吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧玉喙长丹顶圆，亭亭危立风松间。\n啄萍吞鳞意已阑，举头咫尺轻重天。\n黑翎白本排云烟，离羣脱侣孤如仙。\n披霜唳月惊婵娟，逍游忘却还青田。\n鸢寒鸦晚空相喧，时时侧耳清冷泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}